	(text "Motor rail: Q6 switches the system rail to the boost with a soft start (MOTOR_PWR_EN); TPS61288 makes 10 V (VM_SEL low) or 16 V (VM_SEL high).\nBOOST_EN, VM_SEL and MOTOR_PWR_EN come from the RP2354A and are pulled low, so the motor rail is off until the firmware turns it on."
